Package: bettertest
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Iv Robinson <aerobinsoniv@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ivhacks/bettertest
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: python3
Recommends: docker.io | docker-ce, qemu-system-x86, qemu-utils, openssh-client
Description: CI that runs pipelines written in Python
 bettertest is one binary that is both the boss (web UI and API, port 7357
 unless --boss-port) and the worker (runs tasks, port 7358 unless
 --worker-port). Pipelines are Python files in /etc/bettertest/pipedefs. Both
 run as systemd services from installation on.
 docker runs tasks with an image; qemu runs tasks with a vm.
